{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module <<'JS'\nimport { randomInt } from 'node:crypto';\nimport { mkdirSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nconst titles = ['Pick Axe Repeat','Pick Axe Peat','Pick Axe Pete and Greet','Pick Axe Sweet','Pick Axe Beat','Pick Axe Feet','Pick Axe Fleet','Pick Axe Heat','Pick Axe Elite','Pick Axe Retreat','Pick Axe Complete','Pick Axe Concrete','Pick Axe Discreet','Pick Axe Offbeat','Pick Axe Deadbeat','Pick Axe Upbeat','Pick Axe Street','Pick Axe Neat','Pick Axe Cheat','Pick Axe Receipt','Pick Axe Deplete','Pick Axe Replete','Pick Axe Suite','Pick Axe Compete','Pick Axe Parakeet','Pick Axe Bo-Peep','Pick Axe Deep','Pick Axe Leap','Pick Axe Keep','Pick Axe Sleep','Pick Axe Heap','Pick Axe Sweep','Pick Axe Sheep','Pick Axe Beep','Pick Axe Cheap','Pick Axe Steep','Pick Axe Sneak','Pick Axe Peak','Pick Axe Squeak','Pick Axe Chic','Pick Axe Mystique','Pick Axe Technique','Pick Axe Critique','Pick Axe Boutique','Pick Axe Unique','Pick Axe Streak','Pick Axe Freak','Pick Axe Week','Pick Axe Meek','Pick Axe Creek'];\nconst index = randomInt(50); const title=titles[index];\nconst slug = \"'`${title.replaceAll('\"' ','-')}-Pick-Axe-Pete-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-030126\"'`;\nmkdirSync(slug,{recursive:true});\nwriteFileSync('\"'build-config.json',JSON.stringify({title,index,slug,date:'2026-11-06 03:01:26',source:'Pick Axe Pete (1982)'},null,2)+'\\\\n');\nwriteFileSync('PROGRESS.md',\"'`# Progress'\"\\\\n\\\\nGame: \"'${title}'\"\\\\nDevelopment folder: \"'${slug}/'\"\\\\nFinal artifact: \"'${slug}.html'\"\\\\nFeedback: exit-interview.json\\\\n\\\\n## Current state\\\\n- Read TASK.md and complete PLAN.md; native engine + Hub contracts being acquired.\\\\n- Title selected from 50 original riffs with crypto.randomInt(50).\\\\n- Read game-toolchain skill; no existing project files.\\\\n\\\\n## Plan\\\\n1. Vendor dependencies, inspect native APIs and Hub harness; record provenance.\\\\n2. Build deterministic native movement/action/resource simulation and content.\\\\n3. Complete native art/animation, menus, input, procedural audio, co-op and Hub.\\\\n4. Verify full expedition, fairness, inputs, audio and Hub; package and write feedback.\\\\n\\\\n## Constraints\\\\n- All new files under this work directory; do not touch neighboring runs.\\\\n- Single standalone HTML in root; unmodified Hub client must be the first script.\\\\n- Music defaults to 0.1; no audio files.\\\\n- Own only processes started here; test server must use OS-selected loopback port.\\\\n- One quiet verification command with failures + single-line count.\\\\n\"'`);\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({title,index,slug}));\nJS'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module <<'JS'\nimport { randomInt } from 'node:crypto';\nimport { mkdirSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nconst titles = ['Pick Axe Repeat','Pick Axe Peat','Pick Axe Pete and Greet','Pick Axe Sweet','Pick Axe Beat','Pick Axe Feet','Pick Axe Fleet','Pick Axe Heat','Pick Axe Elite','Pick Axe Retreat','Pick Axe Complete','Pick Axe Concrete','Pick Axe Discreet','Pick Axe Offbeat','Pick Axe Deadbeat','Pick Axe Upbeat','Pick Axe Street','Pick Axe Neat','Pick Axe Cheat','Pick Axe Receipt','Pick Axe Deplete','Pick Axe Replete','Pick Axe Suite','Pick Axe Compete','Pick Axe Parakeet','Pick Axe Bo-Peep','Pick Axe Deep','Pick Axe Leap','Pick Axe Keep','Pick Axe Sleep','Pick Axe Heap','Pick Axe Sweep','Pick Axe Sheep','Pick Axe Beep','Pick Axe Cheap','Pick Axe Steep','Pick Axe Sneak','Pick Axe Peak','Pick Axe Squeak','Pick Axe Chic','Pick Axe Mystique','Pick Axe Technique','Pick Axe Critique','Pick Axe Boutique','Pick Axe Unique','Pick Axe Streak','Pick Axe Freak','Pick Axe Week','Pick Axe Meek','Pick Axe Creek'];\nconst index = randomInt(50); const title=titles[index];\nconst slug = \"'`${title.replaceAll('\"' ','-')}-Pick-Axe-Pete-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-030126\"'`;\nmkdirSync(slug,{recursive:true});\nwriteFileSync('\"'build-config.json',JSON.stringify({title,index,slug,date:'2026-11-06 03:01:26',source:'Pick Axe Pete (1982)'},null,2)+'\\\\n');\nwriteFileSync('PROGRESS.md',\"'`# Progress'\"\\\\n\\\\nGame: \"'${title}'\"\\\\nDevelopment folder: \"'${slug}/'\"\\\\nFinal artifact: \"'${slug}.html'\"\\\\nFeedback: exit-interview.json\\\\n\\\\n## Current state\\\\n- Read TASK.md and complete PLAN.md; native engine + Hub contracts being acquired.\\\\n- Title selected from 50 original riffs with crypto.randomInt(50).\\\\n- Read game-toolchain skill; no existing project files.\\\\n\\\\n## Plan\\\\n1. Vendor dependencies, inspect native APIs and Hub harness; record provenance.\\\\n2. Build deterministic native movement/action/resource simulation and content.\\\\n3. Complete native art/animation, menus, input, procedural audio, co-op and Hub.\\\\n4. Verify full expedition, fairness, inputs, audio and Hub; package and write feedback.\\\\n\\\\n## Constraints\\\\n- All new files under this work directory; do not touch neighboring runs.\\\\n- Single standalone HTML in root; unmodified Hub client must be the first script.\\\\n- Music defaults to 0.1; no audio files.\\\\n- Own only processes started here; test server must use OS-selected loopback port.\\\\n- One quiet verification command with failures + single-line count.\\\\n\"'`);\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({title,index,slug}));\nJS'","aggregated_output":"{\"title\":\"Pick Axe Deplete\",\"index\":20,\"slug\":\"Pick-Axe-Deplete-Pick-Axe-Pete-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-030126\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
