{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The core loop is taking shape around tool wear, temporary supplies, and deliberate rock collisions. Each chamber will have permanent ladder routes for recovery, while temporary ladders offer faster, riskier paths. The supplied manual is available; the review PDF returns 404, so I’m recording that research limit.\n"}}
