{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_63","type":"agent_message","text":"Scripted players now complete every route with normal controls and default health, including tool breakage and replacement, both redirect arcs, key collection, door choices, and all extraction waves. Those tests also exposed and helped fix ladder descent and expiry-grace bugs. I’m connecting the playable view, menus, and input modes next.\n"}}
