vents are reliable and deduplicated\", () => {\n373:\ttest(\"full frame reconstructs topology, action, stats and supplies\", () => {\n398:\ttest(\"motion and keyframe ordering retains newest authoritative pose\", () => {\n413:\ttest(\"motion smoothing never steps a client simulation\", () => {\n427:\ttest(\"combined scheduler respects rate, byte and unreliable limits\", () => {\n446:\ttest(\"bounded event batches fit JSON hard limit\", () => {\n465:\ttest(\"carrier departure recovers key and remaining roster\", () => {\n480:\ttest(\"host finishes exactly once with tied cooperative scores\", () => {\n493:\ttest(\"nonplayer authority controls no miner and still replicates\", () => {\n504:\ttest(\"delayed lossy transport preserves controls and authoritative view\", () => {\n518:\ttest(\"end removes listeners, queues and all future traffic\", () => {\n532:\ttest(\"local traversal responds before a packet round trip\", () => {\n545:\ttest(\"prediction cannot collect a key or tool, damage a miner or award gold\", () => {\n594:\ttest(\"lost between-slot jump and redirect retain their press direction\", () => {\n624:\ttest(\"prediction history is bounded without an acknowledgement\", () => {\n635:\t\t\ttest(`full canonical online expedition server=${server} route=${route} 150ms/50ms/5%`, () => {\n672:\tconst result = networkTests();\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 9.8K Nov  6 04:05 docs/network.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
