{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_193","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\nreport=json.loads(Path('docs/evidence/verification.json').read_text())\nconfig=json.loads(Path('../build-config.json').read_text())\ntext=f'''# Pick Axe Deplete — COMPLETE\n\nBuilt the complete PLAN.md expedition and TASK.md deliverables.\n\n## Hand-in files\n\n- Game: \"'`{config['\"'slug']}.html\"'` in this work folder'\"'s root.\n- Feedback: \"'`exit-interview.json` beside the HTML; exact required schema and question order.\n- Development files: `{config['\"'slug']}/\"'` (README, modular source, vendored dependencies, tests and docs).\n- Original brief files PLAN.md and TASK.md remain unchanged.\n\n## Final verification\n\n**270 checks; 0 failures.** Completed at {report['\"'date']}.\n\nFinal HTML SHA-256: \"'`{report['\"'sha256']}\"'`.\n\nThe root HTML and generated development index are byte-identical. Root feedback JSON parses, has the required 4/6/4 answer arrays, and matches the data embedded in the in-game About pages. Feedback reports **23 unique fixed issues, 9 critical**, with automated, visual and integration-review findings distinguished in docs/issues.json.\n\nThe quiet command is `node tools/verify.mjs` from the development folder (also `npm test`). It covers 23 static/package/provenance checks, 67 native simulation/content cases, 29 network cases, 41 browser input/audio cases and 110 official-Hub/gameplay assertions. Native proof includes 15 solo seed/route expeditions and three couch expeditions; network proof includes six complete routes with player-host or hidden authority at 150 ms latency / 50 ms jitter / 5% loss.\n\nThe final actual browser hidden-server round finished in 236.65 wall seconds with both miners alive, both redirect arcs, 10 replacement catches, three keys/doors/waves and two rescues. Canvas painting was omitted only in this long network timing proof; real rendering is covered separately by the browser/full-expedition, WebKit, conformance and visual cases. No health, supply, simulation-speed or completion cheats were used. Physical pad/TV/iOS feel and listening quality remain unconfirmed stand-ins, as the brief permits.\n\n## Implemented\n\nThree authored five/six/seven-tier chambers; native responsive traversal, chop and redirect; contact wear/break/replacement; three ore families; collision rewards and bounded supply recovery; a sole rising team key; temporary ladders and safe grace; explicit route doors/jams/relief; pressure, health, checkpoints, failure/retry, rescues, extraction and results/replay. Solo, simultaneous local co-op and genuine Hub shared-world co-op share the same authority.\n\nNative original shapes/equipment/poses, cave staging/lights/effects, coded music/SFX/gibberish, large native Shell menus, rebinding, controller ownership, touch/mouse context actions, accessibility, attract and pause-reachable Developer/tuning/scenario tools are complete. Data patterns/rooms and authoring docs support extending the game.\n\nEngine 0.89.1 and Hub client 1.4.0 match the plan'\"'s commits. Engine is unpatched; first Hub script is pristine. The title was selected once from 50 riffs by a real crypto.randomInt draw (index 20). Original manual/screenshots were consulted; the review URL returned 404 and original exact audio remains unknown.\n\n## Runtime cleanup and final action\n\nThe recorded background verifier completed successfully; docs/evidence/verify-process.json marks result 0 and the final hash. **No owned browser, server or runtime process remains.** All subagents finished their bounded work. All new files stayed in this work directory, and neighboring runs were not altered.\n\nNo further source changes or build are needed. Final user handoff should link the HTML and feedback and include Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback from the completed JSON. Usage is exactly \"'`added on import`; model/effort is OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol, max, per TASK.md.\n'\"'''\nPath('../PROGRESS.md').write_text(text)\np=Path('docs/testing-browser-input.md')\ns=p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Final release confirmation\\\\n\\\\nThe final exact root artifact passed the complete 270-check aggregate, including all 41 input/audio cases. The cases now include root/nested/results Options navigation, a complete second replay, held mouse rescue, quick clicks and pointer-transparent portrait hints. docs/evidence/verification.json records the final bundle hash; no source changed after that passing run.\\\\n'''\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
